00:17:10,461 --> 00:17:12,582
[SPEAKER_00]: That's how mindfulness becomes unshakable.

258
00:17:13,222 --> 00:17:19,144
[SPEAKER_00]: Whereby, when you forget things and come back from it, the basis remains unaffected.

259
00:17:19,724 --> 00:17:21,905
