00:17:22,475 --> 00:17:24,636
[SPEAKER_00]: When you think about the past, you think in the present moment.

261
00:17:24,656 --> 00:17:27,116
[SPEAKER_00]: When you plan about the future, you plan in the present moment.

262
00:17:27,536 --> 00:17:29,097
[SPEAKER_00]: So, actually, it's not optional for you.

263
