[SPEAKER_00]: You are stuck in the present moment.

264
00:17:30,957 --> 00:17:31,157
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

265
00:17:31,397 --> 00:17:32,598
[SPEAKER_00]: So, it's the recognition of that.

