279
00:18:00,784 --> 00:18:01,024
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

280
00:18:01,224 --> 00:18:03,025
[SPEAKER_00]: Whether I want or not, I'm in the present moment.

281
00:18:03,605 --> 00:18:09,186
