[SPEAKER_00]: Well, without you, really.

284
00:18:29,021 --> 00:18:34,442
[SPEAKER_00]: If you forget those things, then, when you remember, you remember with yourself, you remember with your craving, you remember with your conceit.

285
00:18:35,043 --> 00:18:38,724
[SPEAKER_00]: So, that's why the mindfulness needs to be developed to the extent necessary.

286
